You swap your bullets for more massive ones for [2, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.

When striking a creature, these bullets have a [27%, 34%, 39%, 42%, 46% (TL1-5)] chance of knocking it back 3 tiles and a [11%, 16%, 20%, 23%, 26% (TL1-5)] chance of stunning it for 3 turns.

The chances to knockback and stun increase with your Steampower.

Only one bullet enhancement can be used at once.
